    "chunk_text": "Mine gebro\u00f0ru \u00f0a leofestan, ge sculon to so\u00f0on \u00f0is witan, hwanon w\u00e6re ongunnen \u00e6rest \u00feeos bisne, \u00fe\u00e6t So\u00f0lice \u00fea \u00f0a ure Drihten, \u00fee is \u00e6lmihtig God, gesceop \u00feone forman man Adam, he gesceop hine ealne Seo halignis & rihtwisnis & seo undeadlicnis didon Adam habban Godes silfes anlicnysse & gelicnesse. And for\u00f0an cw\u00e6\u00f0 God \u00e6r\u00f0am he gesceope Adam: Uton wircan man to ure anlicnisse & gelicnisse; \u00fe\u00e6t And \u00feas his anlicnesse us bebead Drihten to habbenne \u00fea \u00f0a he cw\u00e6\u00f0 on his godspelle, Estote sancti, Eornostlice for\u00f0an \u00fee God gesceop Adam swa godne & swa haligne, we r\u00e6da\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he asende hine into So\u00felice on \u00f0am ilcan neorxnawange him forgeaf Drihten ealne wuldor. \u00d0\u00e6r he geseah englas & wi\u00f0 hig spr\u00e6ce, & n\u00e6fre he ne swulte, gif he ne singode. \u00d0\u00e6r he gehyrde Drihten silfne wi\u00f0 hine sprecende & him bebodende swilce gehirsumnisse \u00fe\u00e6t he Ac \u00fea on \u00f0\u00e6re ylcan tide \u00fee Adam \u00feis br\u00e6c & wi\u00f0 God singode, \u00fea adraf hine Drihten, \u00fee is bisceop Ac hw\u00e6t dide Adam si\u00f0\u00f0an he w\u00e6s adr\u00e6fed of neorxnawange? Gewislice he dide swy\u00f0e lange d\u00e6dbote geond syx hundred geara f\u00e6c & \u00feonne gyt mare. \u00c6t nyhstan \u00e6fter his for\u00f0si\u00fee he w\u00e6s asend on hellicne cweartern, \u00fe\u00e6r he lange tyd heofode &",
